# Git Workflow

Commit only when the user asks. Never update git config, skip hooks, or force-push to main/master.

```
<type>: <why>

<optional body>
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `test`, `chore`, `perf`, `ci`

PRs: full `git diff <base>...HEAD`, intent + test plan, `-u` on new branches.
